<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Vetvika from Svarstad — Svarstad–Karihaugen–Vetvika return</name><desc>From Svarstad parking, follow the access road into Svarstaddalen and the marked mountain trail. At the signed fork take the left route over the height north of Karihaugen, passing between Nibba and Karihaugen to the viewpoint above Vetvika. Descend the marked steep trail to the innermost beach. Return along the same trail, including the long climb back over the mountain.

